                <object label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica;line-height:1.32;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:17px&quot;&gt;Login flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;margin-top:9px&quot;&gt;1. Browser requests login → BFF saves encrypted state / nonce / PKCE → Keycloak authenticates.&lt;br/&gt;2. Exact callback → BFF exchanges code privately, validates tokens, saves encrypted credentials → opaque cookie.&lt;br/&gt;3. API request + CSRF when needed → distributed refresh if due → user access token → loan-service.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="Source: docs/authentication-and-sessions.md" id="web-flow">
                    <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f3f6fa;strokeColor=#a4b1c2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#21394e;" vertex="1">
