                <object label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica;line-height:1.32;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:17px&quot;&gt;Lost response, crash or local rollback&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;margin-top:9px&quot;&gt;Remote account may already exist when a job retries.&lt;br/&gt;Lookup the same immutable reference; reuse the account.&lt;br/&gt;Old / expired fenced workers cannot overwrite local results.&lt;br/&gt;Exhaustion → PROVISIONING_FAILED; controlled retry /&lt;br/&gt;reconciliation reuses the same reference. No duplicate loan.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="Source: docs/recovery-and-idempotency.md; loan-service/src/main/java/com/example/loans/service/OperationsService.java" id="provision-recovery">
